# Rhythia+ Changelog

All notable changes to Rhythia+ will be documented here.

---

## Upcoming

### Added
- Customizable hotkeys
- German overlay language
- Improved HUD functionality
- Profile pictures inside Community Profiles

### Changed
- Settings layout redesign
- Community interface improvements

### Fixed
- Various UI and stability improvements

---

## 2.6.7

### Added
- Rhythia+ Control Center
- Map & Skin Library
- Community browser for Maps, Profiles and Skins
- Map and skin downloading with automatic import
- Offline mode
- Customizable HUD Overlay
- Smart HUD Dodge
- Multiple interface themes
- Custom backgrounds
- Accent color customization
- Automatic Rhythia language detection
- Animated Rhythia+ top-bar button
- Steam integration

### Removed
- FLOW

FLOW was removed because it could interfere with game input, cause the overlay to disappear and trigger taskbar flickering.
